  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_AccessoryBase">
    <defName>CVG_Earrings_Water</defName>
    <label>river pearl earrings of water</label>
    <description>Earrings of river pearl strung with the sign of Water. Water is the element of winter and of patience, and the Black Tortoise lineage says that water does not fight the rock, it outlasts it; a Water root wearing them gathers qi as slowly and as surely as a lake fills. Cultivation +15% for a spirit root with Water.</description>
    <graphicData>
