  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_AccessoryBase">
    <defName>CVG_Earrings_Fire</defName>
    <label>cinnabar earrings of fire</label>
    <description>Earrings of cinnabar set in red gold with the sign of Fire. Fire is the element of summer and of the alchemist's furnace; the Vermilion Bird clans gave them to children whose roots burned too hot, so that the fire would rise steadily instead of all at once. Cultivation +15% for a spirit root with Fire.</description>
