  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_AccessoryBase">
    <defName>CVG_Earrings_Earth</defName>
    <label>yellow agate earrings of earth</label>
    <description>Earrings of yellow agate cut with the sign of Earth. Earth is the element of the centre, the one that holds the other four, and the mountain sects bury new pairs under the gate stone for a season before wearing them; an Earth root feels the weight of the mountain behind its breathing. Cultivation +15% for a spirit root with Earth.</description>
